    <statement><p><alert> Matrix Products: </alert> Consider the matrices</p>
<p><me>A = \begin{pmatrix}2\amp 4\amp 5\\5\amp 6\amp 9\end{pmatrix}, 
B = \begin{pmatrix}9\amp 9\amp 4\amp 9\\3\amp 7\amp 2\amp 5\\
    1\amp 9\amp 5\amp 8\end{pmatrix},\textrm{ and }
C = \begin{pmatrix}4\amp 8\\6\amp 8\\9\amp 10\\6\amp 6\end{pmatrix}</me></p>
<p>Of the possible matrix products <m>ABC, ACB, BAC, BCA, CAB, CBA</m>,</p>
<p>which make sense? <fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>B</p>
    </answer>
